格は自己中心的で自意識過剰。 そのうえ攻撃的で毒舌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は神堂栗子として、実家の喫茶店を手伝ったり、大学で勉強したりしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エルフ名で クリスティアナ・クリサリス という立派な名前があり、栗子の名前で呼ばれることには反発している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「正義の心が折れぬ限り、種付けされても受精するものか！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"149309"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7070","sourceWorkId":"22388","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7070","sourceWorkId":"22388","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"165 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7070","sourceWorkId":"22388","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7070","sourceWorkId":"22388","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7070","sourceWorkId":"22388","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"55 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7070","sourceWorkId":"22388","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/adfd18849c95a3fb731785cdb7def1cb011eedc9c1f5d6803c0cb704c38614e9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/6411b0a85f19140699ac7b8096683d5c4bef13b1e27e31376c837e2a1b284cc9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"間宮菜南子","creatorId":"vndb:s999","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s999","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s999","name":"間宮 菜南子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:265176:149309:15995:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c41500","characterName":"Lunatic Magician (ルナティック・マジシャン)","so